brar","forms":[["I / you / we / they crack","I crack the eggs."],["he / she / it cracks","She cracks a nut."]]}]},{"type":"table","head":["Phrasal verb","Significado","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**turn on**","ligar (aparelho)","Turn on the stove. — Ligue o fogão."]],"cap":"Phrasal verbs"}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Making breakfast","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Making breakfast","lines":[["Ana","Is there any cheese?","Tem queijo?"],["Leo","Yes, there is.","Tem."],["Ana","Are there any eggs?","Tem ovos?"],["Leo","There are three.","Três."],["Ana","Turn on the stove, please.","Ligue o fogão, por favor."],["Leo","OK!","Certo!"]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: think/this","items":[{"label":"think/this","note":"Sílaba tônica em palavras de 2 sílabas: OMelette, CHEESE, STOVE, FRIDGE.","words":["omelette","cheese","stove","fridge"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what is in your fridge.","pt":"Diga.","model":"There are two eggs. There is some milk."},{"q":"Give a kitchen command with turn on.","pt":"Diga.","model":"Turn on the stove."},{"q":"Ask: Is there any cheese?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"Is there any cheese?"}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 5-line recipe using there is / are and turn on.","model":"There are two eggs. There is some cheese. Turn on the stove. Break the eggs. Cook for three minutes.","checklist":["Usei **there is/are**","Usei **turn on**","Usei **imperativos**"],"words":"5 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “egg” mean?","opts":["queijo","geladeira","ovo"],"ans":2,"why":"**egg** = ovo."},{"q":"What does “cheese” mean?","opts":["queijo","fogão","minuto"],"ans":0,"why":"**cheese** = queijo."},{"q":"What does “stove” mean?","opts":["geladeira","fogão","cuidadoso"],"ans":1,"why":"**stove** = fogão."},